    },
    {
        "Id": 140,
        "ActionId": 140,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nata",
            "I got it. I've placed it somewhere they'd never think of.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 141,
        "ActionId": 141,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Cecily",
            "...I'll arrange what happens later. Don't be impulsive—we will escape this place with Zikka and Arabella.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 142,
        "ActionId": 142,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
